COMMENT ON COLUMN public.webhook_events.signature_verified IS 'A CHECK-style guarantee in the service layer: a payment is never created from an event whose signature did not verify. CANONICAL.md section 6 marks POST /webhooks/payments as unauthenticated, which makes the signature the only authentication it has.';


